<title>USA: Altoona, Iowa $3.7 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Altoona, Iowa $3.7 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc., said it won $3.7 million of Altoona, Iowa, general obligation library bonds, series 1996A, with a true interest cost of 5.37 percent.</p>
</text>
